  description: "Chapter 10 of Lore.Land: Bone.land Resonance. Bone.land asks what will remain. Mx. BoneWAP, a pie with its joints showing, lays the Egg on the great frame and lets the timber answer: a small wish travels for generations; a grand one come..."
